<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S3 EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S3 EPS view cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it trimmed its 1997 earnings estimate on S3 Inc to $0.60 a share from $0.84.</p>
<p>-- said cut its 1998 estimate to $1.00 a share from $1.30.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, S3 said it expects second quarter revenues of $108 million, plus or minus two percent. The company cited a competitive pricing environment. In last year's second quarter S3 posted net sales of $103.8 million.</p>
<p>-- S3 was off 1/8 to 9-7/8.</p>
</text>
